                    TRANSPORT LAYER
                           │
              ┌────────────┴────────────┐
              │                         │
             TCP                       UDP
              │                         │
      Connection-oriented         Connectionless
              │                         │
      Ordered byte stream          Datagrams
              │                         │
      Acknowledgements            No TCP-style ACK
              │                         │
      Retransmission              No TCP-style
                                   retransmission
              │                         │
      More mechanisms             Lower overhead
              │                         │
      Reliability-oriented        Application-specific
                                   behavior possible
